{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal approach combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) encoders with concat fusion, using singleprofile data. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, establishing a baseline for multimodal fusion in this setup. The effectiveness of concat fusion compared to alternative strategies remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparisons."
}

